@startuml
!include style.puml
top to bottom direction
state "queued" as Q
state "leased" as L
state "running" as R
state "finalizing" as F
state "completed" as C
state "cancel_requested" as X
state "stopped" as S
state "orphaned" as O
state "reconciling" as RE
state "failed" as FAIL
[*] --> Q
Q --> L : atomic claim
L --> R : start confirmed
R --> F : participant finished
F --> C : artifacts committed
R --> X : cancel command
X --> S : children stopped; checkpoint saved
L --> O : lease expired
R --> O : heartbeat lost
F --> O : upload interrupted
O --> RE : check worker + costs + artifacts
RE --> R : original attempt recovered
RE --> Q : old attempt closed; retry allowed
RE --> FAIL : recovery impossible
R --> FAIL : terminal execution error
C --> [*]
S --> [*]
FAIL --> [*]
note bottom of O
  Потеря heartbeat не доказывает остановку процесса.
  Автоповтор может удвоить вычисления и платные вызовы.
end note
@enduml
